   \[
   C_c = \begin{bmatrix} 0 & K_c & K_c \\ K_k & 0 & K_c \\ K_kc & K_kc & 0 \end{bmatrix}
   \]  
   The matrix \( I \) is:  
   \[
   I = \begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 1 \end{bmatrix}
   \]  
   The matrix \( M \) (mass matrix) is:  
   \[
   M = \begin{bmatrix} m_t & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & m_t & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & m_t \end{bmatrix}
   \]  

3. **Solve for Eigen Functions:**  
